            <slug>how-do-i-register-for-the-eeap</slug>
            <mduid>faq1598023863344518</mduid>
            <organizationName>Emergency Management</organizationName>
            <subTopicValue></subTopicValue>
            <pubDateTime>2022-10-07T18:55</pubDateTime>
            <subCategoryValue>hurricane</subCategoryValue><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script><title>Checking Client Information - EEAP Database</title>
               <accordionState></accordionState>
               <content><p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;"><span
                  style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>311 Agent Instructions:</strong></span></p>
                  <p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;">Check
                  if the customer is already in the EEAP Database (Use Below credentials to log into
                  the database).</p>
                  <p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;"><span
                  style="box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration-line: underline;"><span style="box-sizing:
                  inherit; font-weight: 600;">EEAP Database:</span></span></p>
                  <p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;">Link
                  to:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a style="box-sizing: inherit; background-color: transparent; color:
                  #295d92; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;" href="https://www.miamidade.gov/Apps/GIS/EEAP/main/PSNEntryFormLogIn.aspx"><span
                  style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600;">EEAP Registry</span></a></p>
                  <ul style="box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; list-style-type: none;
                  margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 15px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-family: Roboto,
                  sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;">
                  <li style="box-sizing: inherit; list-style-type: none; margin-left: 10px; min-height:
                  30px; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600;">User
                  ID:</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight:
                  600;">311USER</span></li>
                  <li style="box-sizing: inherit; list-style-type: none; margin-left: 10px; min-height:
                  30px; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600;">Password:</span>&nbsp;
                  &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600;">@311userS8</span></li>
                  </ul>
                  <p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;"><span
                  style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; color:
                  #e03e2d;">User ID and Password are case-sensitive.</span></span></p>
                  <p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);
                  font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: #ffffff;"><span
                  style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;"><span
                  style="box-sizing: inherit;"><strong>Note: </strong></span></span>When updating the
                  EEAP Evacuation Status Form, remember to update the section that states "Will Evacuate."
                  Select what the caller is doing. Also, in the comments, use dashes instead of slashes
                  for the date. Make sure the system states the Record is Updated Successfully so OEM
                  can receive the update requested.&nbsp;</p></content>
               <serviceRequestURL>
                  <srType></srType>
               </serviceRequestURL></script><script><title>Related FAQ's / Topics</title>
